# nexora-action-code: get_version
# Official Ruijie sample: https://www.ruijie.com.cn/fw/wt/18252/
# The page shows an EG1000S with RGOS 10.3(4b7), Release(83522).
Value SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_START_TIME (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_UPTIME ([0-9:.]+)
Value SYSTEM_HARDWARE_VERSION ([\w.()+-]+)
Value SYSTEM_SOFTWARE_VERSION (RGOS [^,\r\n]+,\s*Release\([^)]+\))
Value SYSTEM_BOOT_VERSION (\S+)

Start
  ^System description\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
  ^System start time\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_START_TIME}\s*$$
  ^System uptime\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^System hardware version\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_HARDWARE_VERSION}(?:-+.*)?$$
  ^System software version\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_SOFTWARE_VERSION}(?:-+.*)?$$
  ^System BOOT version\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_BOOT_VERSION}\s*$$ -> Record
